@startuml msc-twin-sync
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber "<b>0."

participant "AHDT client" as App
participant "RealtimeHandler\n(WebSocket)" as WS
participant "RealtimeRouter" as Router
participant "AuthService /\nJwtService" as Auth
participant "SearchService\n(APDT query)" as Search
participant "SessionRegistry" as Reg
participant "RealtimeEventRelay" as Relay
participant "InventoryService" as Inv

App -> WS : connect ws://host/ws
App -> WS : {id:1, type:"auth.login", payload}
WS -> Router : route(session, message)
Router -> Auth : login(email, password)
Auth --> Router : JWT + user
Router -> Reg : attach user to session
Router --> App : {id:1, ok:true, data:AuthResponse}

App -> WS : {id:2, type:"search", q, lat, lng}
WS -> Router : route
Router -> Search : search(q, lat, lng, radius)
Search -> Search : bounding box query,\nhaversine filter, sort by\ndistance then price
Router --> App : {id:2, ok:true, data:SearchResponse}

== Physical change at an access point ==

Inv -> Inv : upsert / reserve (transaction)
Inv -> Relay : StockChangedEvent
note right of Relay : @TransactionalEventListener\nfires only after commit
Relay -> Reg : broadcast("stock.changed")
Reg --> App : {event:"stock.changed", storeId,\nproductId, quantity, price}
App -> App : update twin view\n(map pins, offer list, cart)
@enduml
